oauth2 provides a CMake target:

    find_package(oauth2 CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE oauth2::oauth2)

The umbrella header is <oauth2/oauth2.h>. Two pkg-config modules are installed:

    liboauth2        - core OAuth 2.x / OpenID Connect library
    liboauth2_apache - Apache HTTPd bindings

The Apache binding is built against the system apxs/APR development environment
and is consumed through pkg-config rather than an exported CMake target:

    pkg_check_modules(LIBOAUTH2_APACHE REQUIRED IMPORTED_TARGET liboauth2_apache)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE PkgConfig::LIBOAUTH2_APACHE)
